# Copy to .dev.vars — gitignored, read by `wrangler dev` and by the SvelteKit
# dev server's platform proxy. It overrides wrangler.jsonc `vars` locally, which
# is why wrangler.jsonc can hold production values and be deployed as-is.
PUBLIC_ORIGIN="http://localhost:5173"

# Shows the sign-in link on the page instead of only mailing it. Development and
# end-to-end tests only — in production this must not exist, or anyone who types
# someone else's address is handed a working sign-in link.
AUTH_ECHO_LINK="1"

# Without a key, sign-in mail is printed to the terminal instead of sent.
# RESEND_API_KEY=""
